      }
    },
    {
      "content": "门店营业状态含义\n当前门店状态接口用1表示营业中，用0表示打烊中。这里解释状态含义，不能据此认定门店现在营业或已经打烊。\n依据：admin.ShopController.setStatus、getStatus 中的状态说明。",
      "doc_id": "21078b8a-1d0f-3a2b-a6cd-9ce764dbe38f",
      "metadata": {
        "document_title": "万众享门店营业状态实现说明",
        "charset": "UTF-8",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "section_title": "门店营业状态含义",
        "source_type": "code-derived",
        "parent_document_id": "14ca7079-93b8-4a8a-9318-aec8ac2a7832",
        "source": "shop-status-rules-v1.txt",
